    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test cats have broken free! What is this place? To find out you need to compete in the arena. This arena will have minigames that will challenge your cat's skills such as driving skills, agility, and even your ability to cause chaos. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a pre-made cat or create your own from a variety of body types, face shapes, and any colors you can dream up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play alone or with friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are minigames with lawnmowers, jetpacks, skateboards, obstacle courses, and so much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy hats and items for your cat with the rewards you win in these challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive fan letters from cats who shower you with increasing adoration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden items and win medals to uncover the secrets of the lab! Who knows, you might even find out who's behind it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test cats have broken free! What is this place? To find out you need to compete in the arena. This arena will have minigames that will challenge your cat's skills such as driving skills, agility, and even your ability to cause chaos. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a pre-made cat or create your own from a variety of body types, face shapes, and any colors you can dream up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play alone or with friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are minigames with lawnmowers, jetpacks, skateboards, obstacle courses, and so much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy hats and items for your cat with the rewards you win in these challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive fan letters from cats who shower you with increasing adoration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden items and win medals to uncover the secrets of the lab! Who knows, you might even find out who's behind it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The test cats have broken free! They're getting into all the equipment, from jetpacks to lawnmowers and paintball guns! Bounce, bash, and blast your way to the top of the scoreboard! Is there more to the lab? Who's behind it all?",
